					<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Privacy Policy]]></title>
		<link>https://alchemycottage.com/privacy-policy/</link>
		<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:28:52 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[electric-i]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://alchemycottage.com/?page_id=3</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> November 26th, 2026</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Alchemy Cottage (“we,” “us,” or “our”) is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit our website and purchase our products.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">1. Information We Collect</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>When you place an order, we collect information necessary to fulfill that order, including: your name, email address, phone number, and physical shipping address. Your IP address is logged by WordPress and WooCommerce/WooPayments (processed via Stripe) for security and fraud prevention purposes.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">2. Payments and Financial Data</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We use WooPayments (powered by Stripe) to process all transactions. We accept debit/credit cards, Apple Pay, and Google Pay. Alchemy Cottage does not receive or store your full credit card or bank account numbers on our servers; all payment processing is handled securely by Stripe.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong>Future Payment Options:</strong> We are currently working on implementing Monero (XMR) and/or Bitcoin (BTC) payment options via BTCPayServer to provide a more private payment alternative.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">3. Communications and Email</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We use the WP Mail plugin and Brevo to send transactional emails, such as order confirmations and shipping updates. Your email address is processed by these services solely for the purpose of communicating with you regarding your orders.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">4. Customer Reviews</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>To maintain authenticity, reviews can only be posted by customers who have successfully completed an order. Reviews are posted publicly on the website. Providing your name with a review is optional; if provided, it will be visible to the public.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">5. Data Retention</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We store your order information, addresses, and order history for as long as required by Florida law for tax and business record-keeping purposes (typically up to 7 years). Once the legal retention period expires, this data is deleted automatically if it is not associated with any user created account, or manually by the user if it is deleted from within their account page.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">6. Information Sharing and Third Parties</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes. All your personal data remains within Alchemy Cottage, except for essential data transfers to our service providers (Stripe for payments and Brevo for email) required to complete your transaction.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">7. Security and Infrastructure</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We take technical security seriously to protect your data. Our website is hosted on a Linux Debian VPS utilizing LUKS (Linux Unified Key Setup) disk encryption. In the interest of transparency, our website's source code is open source.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We do not restrict privacy-focused IP addresses. We encourage the use of VPNs, TOR, or I2P to browse our website and place orders.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">8. Website Technology</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Currently, our website requires JavaScript to function fully. We are working toward implementing a "No JS" version in the near future to increase accessibility and privacy. We do not currently offer customer account creation; all orders are processed as guest checkouts.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">9. Your Rights</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to request access to the data we hold about you or request that we delete your personal information, subject to our legal obligations to maintain business records under Florida law.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">11. Contact Us</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>For questions regarding your privacy or this policy, please contact us at:</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Alchemy Cottage<br>4042 44th Mnr, Vero Beach FL 32967<br><a href="mailto:email@alchemycottage.com">email@alchemycottage.com</a></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
