		<title><![CDATA[Terms of Service]]></title>
		<link>https://alchemycottage.com/terms-of-service/</link>
		<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:10:43 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[electric-i]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://alchemycottage.com/?page_id=26</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong>Effective date:</strong> November 26th, 2026</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>These Terms of Service (“Terms”) apply to your access to and use of <a href="https://alchemycottage.com">https://alchemycottage.com</a> and purchases from Alchemy Cottage (“Alchemy Cottage,” “we,” “us,” or “our”). By using the website or placing an order, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the website or place an order.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">1. Products and availability</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Alchemy Cottage offers cottage food such as baked goods. Product descriptions, ingredients, prices, and availability are shown on the website and may change.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We may limit quantities, discontinue products, or decline or cancel an order when necessary—for example, if a product is unavailable, an address is outside our service area, or we cannot reasonably confirm that the order can be fulfilled lawfully.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">2. Customer responsibility for local requirements</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Our products are offered for delivery only where the sale and delivery are permitted by applicable law. You are responsible for providing an accurate delivery address and for ensuring that purchasing, receiving, possessing, and using the product complies with laws that apply to you, including applicable state and local requirements.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Your agreement to these Terms does not waive legal requirements or make a prohibited sale or shipment lawful. We may decline or cancel an order if we determine that we cannot lawfully fulfill it.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">3. Food information and allergens</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Please review the product description and package label before ordering or consuming a food product. Product information may identify ingredients and certain allergens, but we cannot guarantee that products are free from cross-contact with allergens. If you have a food allergy or dietary restriction, contact us at <a href="mailto:email@alchemycottage.com">email@alchemycottage.com</a> before ordering. Do not consume a product if you believe it may be unsafe for you.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Products made under Florida’s cottage-food rules include the disclosure required by Florida law on their labels.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">4. Orders and payment</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Your order is an offer to purchase. We may accept or decline it. An order confirmation means we received your order; it does not necessarily mean it has been accepted or shipped. We may cancel an order and refund amounts paid if a product is unavailable, payment is not authorized, or we cannot fulfill the order.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Prices are listed in U.S. dollars. Applicable taxes and shipping charges will be shown at checkout when they apply. Payment is processed by Stripe through WooPayments. We do not receive or store your full payment-card details.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">5. Shipping, delivery, and pickup</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Available shipping, delivery, and pickup options are shown at checkout. You are responsible for entering a complete and accurate address. Delivery estimates are estimates, not guarantees. Once an order is handed to a carrier, delays or disruptions may be outside our control.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Contact us at <a href="mailto:email@alchemycottage.com">email@alchemycottage.com</a> within a few days of delivery if an order arrives damaged, incorrect, or missing. Include your order number and photographs where relevant so we can review the issue.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">6. Cancellations, returns, and refunds</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Nothing in these Terms limits any rights you may have under applicable law. For order problems, contact <a href="mailto:email@alchemycottage.com">email@alchemycottage.com</a> within a few days of delivery.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">7. Website use</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>You agree not to misuse the website, interfere with its operation, attempt unauthorized access, or use it to violate applicable law. We may suspend access to the website if we reasonably believe these Terms have been violated.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">8. Disclaimers and liability</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The website and its content are provided on an “as available” basis. To the extent permitted by law, Alchemy Cottage disclaims implied warranties that may apply to website use. Nothing in these Terms excludes a warranty or liability that cannot legally be excluded.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>To the extent permitted by law, Alchemy Cottage is not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from website use or an order. This section does not limit liability where applicable law prohibits that limitation.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">9. Privacy</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Our collection and use of personal information are described in our <a href="https://alchemycottage.com/privacy-policy/" data-type="page" data-id="3">Privacy Policy</a>. Please review that policy before placing an order.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">11. Changes to these Terms</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We may update these Terms by posting a revised version on the website and changing the effective date above. Changes apply from the date they are posted. The Terms in effect when you place an order apply to that order, except where applicable law requires otherwise.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">12. Governing law</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Florida, except where another law must apply. Any venue or dispute-resolution provision must be consistent with applicable consumer-protection laws.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">13. Contact</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Questions about these Terms or an order?</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Alchemy Cottage<br>4042 44th Mnr, Vero Beach FL 32967<br><a href="mailto:email@alchemycottage.com">email@alchemycottage.com</a><br><br></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
